<p style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;">Offbeat-Familie Demo (160 BPM, F-Moll, 32 Takte): Engine (Kick, Bass, Hats), Topline (Akkorde, Melodie, Pfeife), Hydraulics pumpt die Synths per Peak Controller von der Kick, Turbo (Auto) auf dem Master.</p></body></html>]]></projectnotes>
